"を介して公開されています。無線をオンにする前に、付属のアンテナをオンボードの **U.FL コネクタ**\\ に接続してください::"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:509
msgid "Bluetooth"
msgstr "Bluetooth"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref/arduino-portenta-h7.rst:511
msgid ""
"The same Murata 1DX also exposes Bluetooth LE 5.1. Use "
":doc:`/library/aioble` for asyncio‑friendly BLE — for example, advertise as "
